<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"><ttm:name type="full">當山みれい</ttm:name></ttm:agent><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">终于能够一起连休</text><text for="L2">相依着在房间里</text><text for="L3">制定旅游计划</text><text for="L4">看着手机和旅游指南</text><text for="L5">一来一回交流讨论的时间</text><text for="L6">已经承载着我的快乐</text><text for="L7">被倒映在水面上樱花照耀了的春天</text><text for="L8">穿着一起挑选的泳衣嬉笑玩耍的夏天</text><text for="L9">一起在被秋色浸染的</text><text for="L10">鳞次栉比的杏树下散步</text><text for="L11">在白雪皑皑覆盖的树下同欢共笑</text><text for="L12">无论是快乐的日子 还是不甘现状的日子</text><text for="L13">都想在身旁听你倾诉</text><text for="L14">无论何时</text><text for="L15">都想和你一直在一起的春夏秋冬</text><text for="L16">今年春天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L17">今年夏天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L18">无论是春天的樱花还是夏天的大海</text><text for="L19">都想与你共赏</text><text for="L20">想要你在我身旁</text><text for="L21">今年秋天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L22">今年冬天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L23">秋天的红叶以及冬天的白雪</text><text for="L24">都想与你共赏</text><text for="L25">想要你在我身旁</text><text for="L26">那些对我而言的特别的日子</text><text for="L27">觉得是理所当然</text><text for="L28">而我却又贪得无厌</text><text for="L29">什么才是真正的爱呢？</text><text for="L30">过分追求形式</text><text for="L31">反而错过了许多</text><text for="L32">当你指责颓废的我时</text><text for="L33">我才发现</text><text for="L34">比我更加了解自己的</text><text for="L35">正是你呀</text><text for="L36">也只有你呀</text><text for="L37">我不够坦率</text><text for="L38">也没有那么可爱</text><text for="L39">和我在一起真的好吗</text><text for="L40">有时候我总会因此而感到不安</text><text for="L41">但，如果是和你一起</text><text for="L42">我愿许下永恒的誓言</text><text for="L43">羁绊着我们无名指的证明</text><text for="L44">教会的钟声响起</text><text for="L45">与羞涩的你</text><text for="L46">四目相对 爱恋交汇</text><text for="L47">一起去寻找</text><text for="L48">新的风景吧</text><text for="L49">寻找你我二人的春夏秋冬</text><text for="L50">今年春天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L51">今年夏天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L52">无论是春天的樱花还是夏天的大海</text><text for="L53">都想与你共赏</text><text for="L54">想要你在我身旁</text><text for="L55">今年秋天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L56">今年冬天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L57">秋天的红叶以及冬天的白雪</text><text for="L58">都想与你共赏</text><text for="L59">想要你在我身旁</text><text for="L60">无论是特别的纪念日</text><text for="L61">还是平平无奇的日常</text><text for="L62">都满载着你为我创造的回忆</text><text for="L63">无论是哪里</text><text for="L64">你都会带着我去</text><text for="L65">告诉了许多好玩的地方</text><text for="L66">但其实呀</text><text for="L67">目的地不重要</text><text for="L68">让我世界大放异彩的</text><text for="L69">正是你呀</text><text for="L70">如果以后</text><text for="L71">我们有了孩子</text><text for="L72">只有这个地方</text><text for="L73">一定要告诉他</text><text for="L74">那就是</text><text for="L75">我们交换誓言的</text><text for="L76">那个夏末</text><text for="L77">我们一同歌颂爱情的圣地</text><text for="L78">今年春天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L79">今年夏天我们要哪里呢？</text><text for="L80">无论是春天的樱花还是夏天的大海</text><text for="L81">都想与你共赏</text><text for="L82">想要你在我身旁</text><text for="L83">今年秋天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L84">今年冬天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L85">秋天的红叶以及冬天的白雪</text><text for="L86">都想与你共赏</text><text for="L87">想要你在我身旁</text><text for="L88">今年春天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L89">今年夏天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L90">无论是春天的樱花还是夏天的大海</text><text for="L91">都想与你共赏</text><text for="L92">想要你在我身旁</text><text for="L93">今年秋天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L94">今年冬天我们去哪里呢？</text><text for="L95">秋天的红叶以及冬天的白雪</text><text for="L96">都想与你共赏</text><text for="L97">想要和你一起</text><text for="L98">和你一起...</text><text for="L99">和你一起...</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="春夏秋冬 reprise"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MIREI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="still"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1555193623"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:00.725" end="0:14.335" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="0:00.725" end="0:04.255" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:00.725" end="0:01.085">や</span><span begin="0:01.085" end="0:01.285">っ</span><span begin="0:01.285" end="0:01.595">と</span><span begin="0:01.595" end="0:01.835">一</span><span begin="0:01.835" end="0:02.145">緒</span><span begin="0:02.145" end="0:02.785">に</span><span begin="0:02.785" end="0:03.425">取れた</span><span begin="0:03.425" end="0:03.795">連</span><span begin="0:03.795" end="0:04.255">休</span></p><p begin="0:04.465" end="0:05.965" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:04.465" end="0:04.975">部屋</span><span begin="0:04.975" end="0:05.125">で</span><span begin="0:05.125" end="0:05.965">寄り添って</span></p><p begin="0:05.965" end="0:07.655" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:05.965" end="0:06.815">計画</span><span begin="0:06.815" end="0:07.105">を</span><span begin="0:07.105" end="0:07.315">練</span><span begin="0:07.315" end="0:07.655">る</span></p><p begin="0:07.875" end="0:10.755" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:07.875" end="0:08.085">ス</span><span begin="0:08.085" end="0:08.355">マ</span><span begin="0:08.355" end="0:08.545">ホ</span><span begin="0:08.545" end="0:09.065">とガ</span><span begin="0:09.065" end="0:09.415">イド</span><span begin="0:09.415" end="0:09.695">ブッ</span><span begin="0:09.695" end="0:09.805">ク</span><span begin="0:09.805" end="0:10.225">眺</span><span begin="0:10.225" end="0:10.755">めて</span></p><p begin="0:10.915" end="0:12.635" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:10.915" end="0:11.345">話</span><span begin="0:11.345" end="0:11.805">し合う</span><span begin="0:11.805" end="0:11.995">時</span><span begin="0:11.995" end="0:12.435">間</span><span begin="0:12.435" end="0:12.635">が</span></p><p begin="0:12.635" end="0:14.335" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:12.635" end="0:12.755">も</span><span begin="0:12.755" end="0:13.045">う</span><span begin="0:13.045" end="0:13.475">楽</span><span begin="0:13.475" end="0:13.665">し</span><span begin="0:13.665" end="0:13.925">く</span><span begin="0:13.925" end="0:14.335">て</span></p></div><div begin="0:14.615" end="0:41.595" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="0:14.615" end="0:17.765" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:14.615" end="0:14.925">水面</span><span begin="0:14.925" end="0:15.315">に</span><span begin="0:15.315" end="0:15.625">映</span><span begin="0:15.625" end="0:15.825">る</span><span begin="0:15.825" end="0:17.125">桜輝</span><span begin="0:17.125" end="0:17.295">く</span><span begin="0:17.295" end="0:17.765">春</span></p><p begin="0:17.925" end="0:21.245" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:17.925" end="0:18.635">一緒に</span><span begin="0:18.635" end="0:19.005">選</span><span begin="0:19.005" end="0:19.235">んだ</span><span begin="0:19.235" end="0:19.665">水</span><span begin="0:19.665" end="0:19.945">着</span><span begin="0:19.945" end="0:20.105">で</span><span begin="0:20.105" end="0:20.565">遊</span><span begin="0:20.565" end="0:20.775">ぶ</span><span begin="0:20.775" end="0:21.245">夏</span></p><p begin="0:21.395" end="0:22.955" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:21.395" end="0:21.805">秋</span><span begin="0:21.805" end="0:22.115">色</span><span begin="0:22.115" end="0:22.275">に</span><span begin="0:22.275" end="0:22.535">染</span><span begin="0:22.535" end="0:22.955">まる</span></p><p begin="0:22.955" end="0:24.675" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:22.955" end="0:23.405">いちょう</span><span begin="0:23.405" end="0:24.015">並木</span><span begin="0:24.015" end="0:24.675">歩き</span></p><p begin="0:24.815" end="0:27.535" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:24.815" end="0:25.085">銀</span><span begin="0:25.085" end="0:25.235">世</span><span begin="0:25.235" end="0:25.555">界</span><span begin="0:25.555" end="0:26.425">ツリーの下</span><span begin="0:26.425" end="0:26.745">笑</span><span begin="0:26.745" end="0:27.045">いあ</span><span begin="0:27.045" end="0:27.535">い</span></p><p begin="0:27.675" end="0:30.865" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:27.675" end="0:28.395">嬉しい</span><span begin="0:28.395" end="0:28.675">日</span><span begin="0:28.675" end="0:29.345">も</span><span begin="0:29.345" end="0:30.075">悔しい</span><span begin="0:30.075" end="0:30.385">日</span><span begin="0:30.385" end="0:30.865">も</span></p><p begin="0:30.965" end="0:35.235" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:30.965" end="0:31.565">そば</span><span begin="0:31.565" end="0:31.695">で</span><span begin="0:31.695" end="0:31.982">話</span><span begin="0:31.982" end="0:33.395">聞いてたい</span><span begin="0:33.395" end="0:33.671">か</span><span begin="0:33.671" end="0:35.235">ら</span></p><p begin="0:35.495" end="0:37.675" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:35.495" end="0:36.675">いつまでも</span><span begin="0:36.675" end="0:37.455">あなた</span><span begin="0:37.455" end="0:37.675">と</span></p><p begin="0:37.675" end="0:41.595" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:37.675" end="0:38.775">ずっと</span><span begin="0:38.775" end="0:39.405">いたい</span><span begin="0:39.405" end="0:39.565">の</span><span begin="0:39.565" end="0:40.055">春</span><span begin="0:40.055" end="0:40.195">夏</span><span begin="0:40.195" end="0:40.635">秋</span><span begin="0:40.635" end="0:41.595">冬</span></p></div><div begin="0:41.895" end="1:12.095" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="0:41.895" end="0:45.385" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:41.895" end="0:42.225">今</span><span begin="0:42.225" end="0:43.085">年</span><span begin="0:43.085" end="0:43.185">の</span><span begin="0:43.185" end="0:43.715">春</span><span begin="0:43.715" end="0:43.945">は</span><span begin="0:43.945" end="0:44.375">どこ</span><span begin="0:44.375" end="0:44.505">に</span><span begin="0:44.505" end="0:45.025">行こう</span><span begin="0:45.025" end="0:45.385">か</span></p><p begin="0:45.425" end="0:49.005" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:45.425" end="0:45.675">今</span><span begin="0:45.675" end="0:46.485">年</span><span begin="0:46.485" end="0:46.655">の</span><span begin="0:46.655" end="0:47.155">夏</span><span begin="0:47.155" end="0:47.395">は</span><span begin="0:47.395" end="0:47.815">どこ</span><span begin="0:47.815" end="0:47.925">に</span><span begin="0:47.925" end="0:48.425">行こう</span><span begin="0:48.425" end="0:49.005">か</span></p><p begin="0:49.175" end="0:52.355" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:49.175" end="0:49.705">春</span><span begin="0:49.705" end="0:49.915">の</span><span begin="0:49.915" end="0:50.555">桜</span><span begin="0:50.555" end="0:50.775">も</span><span begin="0:50.775" end="0:51.265">夏</span><span begin="0:51.265" end="0:51.865">の海</span><span begin="0:51.865" end="0:52.355">も</span></p><p begin="0:52.445" end="0:54.045" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:52.445" end="0:53.085">あなた</span><span begin="0:53.085" end="0:53.474">と見た</span><span begin="0:53.474" end="0:54.045">い</span></p><p begin="0:54.165" end="0:55.685" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:54.165" end="0:54.815">あなた</span><span begin="0:54.815" end="0:55.107">といた</span><span begin="0:55.107" end="0:55.685">い</span></p><p begin="0:55.685" end="0:59.095" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:55.685" end="0:55.945">今</span><span begin="0:55.945" end="0:56.775">年</span><span begin="0:56.775" end="0:57.045">の</span><span begin="0:57.045" end="0:57.445">秋</span><span begin="0:57.445" end="0:57.685">は</span><span begin="0:57.685" end="0:58.085">どこ</span><span begin="0:58.085" end="0:58.205">に</span><span begin="0:58.205" end="0:58.725">行こう</span><span begin="0:58.725" end="0:59.095">か</span></p><p begin="0:59.125" end="1:02.695" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:59.125" end="0:59.385">今</span><span begin="0:59.385" end="1:00.175">年</span><span begin="1:00.175" end="1:00.375">の</span><span begin="1:00.375" end="1:00.865">冬</span><span begin="1:00.865" end="1:01.095">は</span><span begin="1:01.095" end="1:01.515">どこ</span><span begin="1:01.515" end="1:01.635">に</span><